   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Material humanitarian aid Bosna and Herzegovina 2017/2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Materi&#xe1;lna HP Bosna a Hercegovina 2017/2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Material humanitarian aid provided by the Ministry of Interior in 2017 to the Ministry of Interior of BaH. The provided aid consisted of&#xa0;sleeping bags, blankets , carriages and field folding beds in the amount of EUR 10 167.99 and the aid provided by the Ecumenical Pastoral Headquarter of the Armed Forces of the SR of hygienic packages, clothing and medical supplies valued at EUR 2 932.66. The total value of the provided humanitarian aid for the Red Cross to the Canton of Sarajevo was EUR 13,075,31.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Materi&#xe1;lna humanit&#xe1;rna pomoc poskytnut&#xe1; Ministerstvom vn&#xfa;tra SR v roku 2017 pre Ministerstvo vn&#xfa;tra BaH.&#xa0;Na z&#xe1;klade aktu&#xe1;lnej situ&#xe1;cie v Bosne a Hercegovine, inform&#xe1;ci&#xed; od velite&#x13e;a EUFOR LOT Novo Sarajevo, &#x17e;iadosti &#x10c;erven&#xe9;ho kr&#xed;&#x17e;a Kantonu Sarajevo o materi&#xe1;lnu pomoc pre postihnut&#xe9; obyvate&#x13e;stvo v oblastiach p&#xf4;sobenia Ozbrojen&#xfd;ch s&#xed;l SR vy&#x10d;lenilo Ministerstvo vn&#xfa;tra SR zo svojich z&#xe1;sob materi&#xe1;lnu humanit&#xe1;rnu pomoc pozost&#xe1;vaj&#xfa;cu zo spac&#xed;ch vakov, prikr&#xfd;vok, karimatiek a po&#x13e;n&#xfd;ch skladac&#xed;ch postel&#xed; v hodnote 10 167,99 Eur a &#xda;stredie ekumenickej pastora&#x10d;nej slu&#x17e;by OS SR a OZ SR hygienick&#xfd;ch bal&#xed;&#x10d;kov, oble&#x10d;enia a zdravotn&#xed;ckeho materi&#xe1;lu v hodnote 2 932,66 Eur. Celkov&#xe1; hodnota poskytnutej materi&#xe1;lnej humanit&#xe1;rnej pomoci SR pre &#x10c;erven&#xfd; kr&#xed;&#x17e; Kantonu Sarajevo bola 13 075,31 Eur a hmotnosti 3 028,62 kg.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
